WEBVTT

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:50.730
There are other intruders
besides Saga and the others.

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:59.010
The Cloth of Athena

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:03.500
Listen carefully.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:07.470
I'll tell you the meaning
of Athena and Shaka's death.

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:12.370
The entire truth.

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:17.310
The entire truth?

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.640
What is he talking about?

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:47.960
Athena, who knew you would
take your own life?

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:55.740
You understood the pain in our hearts.

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:01.900
Why are you crying now?

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:06.440
You're the ones who drove Athena to death!

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:10.420
I told you to get a hold of yourself.

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:19.640
Even though we're dead,
we're still Athena's Saints.

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:26.510
None of us would change loyalty to Hades.

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:36.650
Me, Saga and the others,
we are all Athena's Saints.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:45.110
Even if Hades lures us with
the promise of eternal life,

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:48.780
we would never come to take Athena's life!

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:50.400
Nonsense!

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:55.560
Then why insist on taking her life?

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:59.500
That's right. We will never forgive you.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:01.250
Wait, Seiya.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:02.020
Shun.

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:04.450
What's the truth?

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:07.350
Right. Let's hear it.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:13.230
You'll never forgive us. Right.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:19.840
It's all for this.

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:31.280
Sacred Cloth!

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:37.650
After 243 years, it is time to awake!

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:44.120
Come back to life by the blood of Athena!

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:39.680
Athena's statue...

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:41.520
Has disappeared.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:49.400
It hasn't disappeared. Look carefully.

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:02.220
What's this?

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:07.770
That enormous statue of Athena.

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:13.750
That is the Cloth of Athena.

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:17.550
This is Athena's Cloth.

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:26.420
As your Cloths need blood to be revived,

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:31.650
Athena's Cloth requires the blood

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:34.890
of Athena to be revived.

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:40.940
Athena's blood?

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:49.980
But the only one who knows

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:53.680
that is me, the Pope.

00:08:55.170 --> 00:09:00.820
To defeat Hades, Athena
must also bear her Cloth.

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:07.140
I had to get Athena to put
on the Cloth at all cost.

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:11.470
That is when...

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:18.550
Hades came to us in the eternal sleep
of death and offered a proposition.

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:26.550
If we were to take Athena's head,

00:09:26.550 --> 00:09:28.800
he would free us from the Underworld.

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:31.890
And give us eternal life.

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:38.730
We pretended to take him up on his offer

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:41.200
and returned to the 12 houses.

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:53.970
We will forever be branded as traitors.

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:56.060
Are you fine with that?

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:04.890
Thank you.

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:13.350
We did it all for Athena's Cloth.

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:22.370
Deathmask, Aphrodite, even them.

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:27.840
That's why we went as far as
to use the Athena Exclamation.

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:31.430
Even facing banishment by Athena.

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:37.370
They hid the truth from
Hades, risking it all.

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:39.800
Can you understand?

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:50.190
I had no idea.

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:54.100
Everyone, all for Athena.

00:10:55.700 --> 00:11:01.330
We didn't know. No, we didn't try to know.

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:09.610
Tell us, Shion. What are we supposed to do?

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:18.570
Now that even Athena's
dead, what are we to do?

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:26.860
I order you, as the Pope.

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:37.420
The time to strike down Hades has come!

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:42.820
Storm the Hades Castle and defeat Hades!

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:57.820
As expected, the ultimate Gold Saint.

00:11:58.130 --> 00:12:02.210
You have brought back Athena's
corpse within 12 hours.

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:08.200
Now, remove the veil and
show me Athena's dead face.

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:10.000
Before that...

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:18.720
Hades said he would give us
eternal life if we killed Athena.

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:21.850
There's no mistake about that, right?

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:24.210
Must you ask?

00:12:24.670 --> 00:12:30.460
Be assured, Lord Hades does not lie.

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:32.370
Well...

00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:42.110
I would like to show Lord Hades
Athena's dead face personally.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.060
You cannot.

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:50.540
Lord Hades is God, he does not
show his face before humans.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:54.420
It's sufficient if I see.

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:58.320
Now, remove the Cloth.

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:13.970
Frog, remove the veil.

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:16.180
Yes, immediately.

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:34.740
What's this?

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:46.780
The temple is screaming
after losing Athena's Cosmo.

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:56.260
I told you.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:01.120
The real battle starts now.

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:05.640
The real battle.

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:12.750
Athena and Shaka haven't
necessarily given up.

00:14:13.110 --> 00:14:16.040
The dead Athena and Shaka?

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:20.580
That is...

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:30.600
Shion.

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:32.230
Shion.

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:32.930
Shion.

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:36.730
The temporary life Hades gave us.

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:43.230
Ends at sunrise, it was only 12 hours.

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:49.530
This body will soon turn to dust.

00:14:50.190 --> 00:14:54.860
And we will go back to our
eternal sleep in the Underworld.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.130
No way.

00:14:56.130 --> 00:14:58.580
But before that...

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:02.060
I have something to give you.

00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:19.990
Resurrect by the blood
of Athena, Bronze Cloths!

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:47.350
This is?

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:51.550
I thought it couldn't be repaired.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:55.480
Our Cloths.

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:00.690
That's right.

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:05.280
They've been revived by Athena's blood.

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:10.000
The ultimate final Cloths.

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:12.520
Shion.

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:17.080
You must hurry to the Hades Castle.

00:16:17.650 --> 00:16:18.490
Ah.

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:24.650
If you go now, you can catch up
to Aioria and the others' Cosmo.

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:31.680
Deliver this Cloth to Athena.

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:34.120
All right.

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:41.100
We have received Athena's Cloth
along with your conviction.

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:50.360
Now, there is no time to waste.

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:52.530
Hurry to the Hades Castle!

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:12.760
I'm counting on you, young Saints of Athena.

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:31.520
It seems like the big rats are here.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.250
We will have you let us pass.

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:50.840
Where are you going?

00:17:50.990 --> 00:17:55.450
You already know. We are
going to protect Athena.

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:56.280
Mmm.

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:03.220
I feel sorry for you, Saints.

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:04.890
What did you say?

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:10.220
Saints are nothing but a
nuisance to Lord Hades.

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:17.270
If you don't realize
that, I further pity you.

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:21.930
You can talk all you want,
but don't regret it later.

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:28.100
I've never regretted a thing in my life.

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:34.130
Then now is the time.

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:37.470
Clear the way.

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:40.760
Lightning Plasma!

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:50.980
What?

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:56.860
Pitiful.

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:04.390
Scarlet Needle!

00:19:09.070 --> 00:19:12.330
Starlight Extinction!

00:19:23.280 --> 00:19:24.930
Do you still not understand?

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:28.340
This is Lord Hades' domain.

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:31.000
If you fall off that cliff,

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:34.310
you won't be able to climb
up out of the Underworld.

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:35.590
Cocytus.

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:42.470
You guys are defenseless infants.

00:20:02.730 --> 00:20:03.750
Aioria!

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:29.410
Crystal Wall!

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:48.760
Is this the power of a Specter?

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:04.560
You may know, but my fists are Excalibur.

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:07.400
If you move, you'll lose your head.

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:14.400
Stand back. What are you
trying to do to Miss Pandora?

00:21:20.870 --> 00:21:25.750
We don't want to use force
on a woman, even an enemy.

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:29.000
Take us to Hades.

00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:37.270
What will you do when you meet Lord Hades.

00:21:37.390 --> 00:21:39.900
Of course, take his head.

00:21:40.470 --> 00:21:44.060
For sure this time, on our own will.

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:48.790
I see. Honorable are Athena's Saints.

00:21:49.790 --> 00:21:55.040
However, haven't you forgotten
something important?

00:22:06.870 --> 00:22:12.400
Fools. The reason you are alive

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:16.650
is because Lord Hades
gave you temporary life.

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:25.000
Those who don't appreciate this gift will
fall into hell for eternal suffering.

00:22:25.280 --> 00:22:29.680
My remaining energy is rapidly being drained.

00:22:30.070 --> 00:22:32.950
What? What did you do?

00:22:33.040 --> 00:22:35.380
I haven't done anything.

00:22:35.730 --> 00:22:41.520
You have only bathed in the sunlight
coming through the skylight.

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:45.870
Twelve hours of life given
to you by Lord Hades.

00:22:47.120 --> 00:22:50.740
The time for that life to fade has come.

00:22:51.610 --> 00:22:53.030
Does it hurt?

00:22:53.320 --> 00:22:56.320
Are you afraid of returning
to the Underworld?

00:22:57.060 --> 00:22:58.330
Impossible.

00:23:03.520 --> 00:23:05.420
Tell me one thing.

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:08.880
Then I'll ask Lord Hades

00:23:09.160 --> 00:23:14.250
to extend your life.

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:20.870
Where is Athena, who is supposed to be dead?

00:23:25.150 --> 00:23:30.200
Athena is God, but her flesh is human.

00:23:35.690 --> 00:23:41.210
A person who passes has only one
place to go, the Underworld.

00:23:41.560 --> 00:23:43.280
You still play games.

00:23:45.330 --> 00:23:48.490
No, if what Saga says is true,

00:23:49.320 --> 00:23:53.440
Athena chose death and
headed to the Underworld.

00:23:54.440 --> 00:23:55.470
Could it be?

00:23:55.850 --> 00:23:59.070
Athena is seeking a confrontation
with Lord Hades?

00:24:08.070 --> 00:24:10.610
Weak fools like you

00:24:10.700 --> 00:24:15.040
should fall into Cocytus and suffer eternally

00:24:15.390 --> 00:24:17.930
in your own weakness and naivety.

00:24:20.350 --> 00:24:21.390
Aioria!

00:24:35.330 --> 00:24:36.690
This Cosmo.

00:24:37.000 --> 00:24:38.030
Could it be?

00:24:43.000 --> 00:24:43.970
Who is it?

00:24:47.800 --> 00:24:50.710
No introduction needed,
we're Athena's Saints!
